    "long_instructions": "Use **PAIR Programming with AI** to help manage your postings:\r\n\r\n* **Prompt:** Ask AI to generate or explain a helper.\r\n\r\n* **Analyze:** Compare two possible versions or lines of code.\r\n\r\n* **Integrate:** Implement and test in the display.\r\n\r\n* **Reflect:** Write a short statement about how helper functions protect data consistency in *reflection.md*\r\n\r\n---\r\n### ☔ Weather Alert!\r\n**Status:** Event Cancelled\r\n\r\n**Details:** The forecast is heavy rain. The outdoor \"Streetwear Shoot\" scheduled for the end of the week is cancelled.\r\n\r\n**Action Required:** *pop()* the last post from your schedule so the slot is empty.\r\n",
